    "visible": true,
    "links": []
   },
   {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "The following ODOT construction projects are anticipated to impact traffic in Washington County. All outlined work is weather permitting. Visit OHGO.com for travel updates or follow ODOT District 10 on Facebook or X for current Washington County construction information.",
    "textContent": "The following ODOT construction projects are anticipated to impact traffic in Washington County. All outlined work is weather permitting. Visit OHGO.com for travel updates or follow ODOT District 10 on Facebook or X for current Washington County construction information.",
